{"about_the_game":"<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >You are a little reaper</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i>The Grass Reaper</i> is an active incremental/clicker game.\u00a0When you cut one grass tile, you get one soul. It's simple and chill. But you have the power to do so much more...</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3879530/extras/0c62e2e8fcb772c98ca44b1a05bdb7e6.poster.avif?t=1756703707\" width=400 height=200 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3879530/extras/0c62e2e8fcb772c98ca44b1a05bdb7e6.webm?t=1756703707\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3879530/extras/0c62e2e8fcb772c98ca44b1a05bdb7e6.mp4?t=1756703707\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Collect souls to unlock your power</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The game offers several upgrades, allowing players to utilise their powers to destroy map tiles efficiently. Strike down lightning or set the ground on fire. You can reach hellish speeds.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3879530/extras/4479956af9f88c606ddbef3dff3d226f.poster.avif?t=1756703707\" width=400 height=200 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3879530/extras/4479956af9f88c606ddbef3dff3d226f.webm?t=1756703707\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3879530/extras/4479956af9f88c606ddbef3dff3d226f.mp4?t=1756703707\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Reap Everything</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >All map objects are destructible.\u00a0You can destroy every corner of the map, or try the endless mode for further upgrades.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3879530/extras/abcd0afca1e067a6c1fbcee6628ed56a.poster.avif?t=1756703707\" width=400 height=200 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3879530/extras/abcd0afca1e067a6c1fbcee6628ed56a.webm?t=1756703707\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3879530/extras/abcd0afca1e067a6c1fbcee6628ed56a.mp4?t=1756703707\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3879530?t=1756703707","background_raw":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3879530?t=1756703707","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3879530/8fed7c0db91be4ccb8658043c9e143300a793da4/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1756703707","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3879530/8fed7c0db91be4ccb8658043c9e143300a793da4/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1756703707","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Camera Comfort","id":67},{"description":"Custom Volume Controls","id":68},{"description":"Keyboard Only Option","id":75},{"description":"Playable without Timed Input","id":74},{"description":"Stereo Sound","id":69},{"description":"Partial Controller Support","id":18},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[],"notes":null},"detailed_description":"<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >You are a little reaper</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i>The Grass Reaper</i> is an active incremental/clicker game.\u00a0When you cut one grass tile, you get one soul. It's simple and chill. But you have the power to do so much more...</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><spa